# Default typography — Body/Small

For **EverGreen Website** (`@eds/website-*`), treat **Body/Small** as the default text size unless Figma explicitly specifies another Text Style.

## Tokens

- Regular: `--eds-body-small-size`, `--eds-body-small-weight`, `--eds-body-small-line-height`
- Emphasis (500): `--eds-body-small-strong-*`
- CSS class: `.typography-body-small` / `.typography-body-small-strong` (showcase / docs preview only)

Body/Small is **16px** with the Website line-height token (not Desktop body-medium).

## When implementing components

- Default control copy (Input value, Button Lg–Sm labels, labels, table cells, nav): **body-small** or **body-small-strong**
- Use **body-medium** or larger only when the spec names a different style (e.g. section titles, display text)
- Do not default `body` / root to `body-medium` in Website apps or `@eds/website-components`

## Examples

```css
/* ✅ default control text */
font-size: var(--eds-body-small-size);
font-weight: var(--eds-body-small-weight);
line-height: var(--eds-body-small-line-height);

/* ✅ default emphasis (e.g. button label) */
font-weight: var(--eds-body-small-strong-weight);

/* ❌ avoid as unnamed default */
font-size: var(--eds-body-medium-size);
```
